# API Contract

Base path: `/api/v1`

## Endpoints

| Method | Path | Response |
|--------|------|----------|
| GET | `/words` | `Word[]` — optional `?word_set_id=` |
| GET | `/words/:id` | `Word` + `word_sets[]` + `dictionary_entries[]` — optional `?language=en` (default `en`) |
| GET | `/word_sets` | `WordSet[]` with `words_count` |
| GET | `/word_sets/:id` | `WordSet` metadata + `words_count` (no embedded words) |
| GET | `/word_sets/:id/words` | `{ words, pagination }` — optional `?language=en` |
| GET | `/search?q=` | `{ query, words, word_sets, pagination }` |

## Word shape

```json
{
  "id": 1, "content": "食べる", "kana": "たべる",
  "word_count": 0, "reading": "たべる",
  "tags": [{ "id": 1, "name": "counter" }],
  "frequencies": [{ "table": "jpdb", "frequency": 100, "ratio": 0.5 }]
}
```

## Pagination (word set words)

`{ page, per_page, total_count, total_pages }` — defaults: page 1, per_page 50, max 100

## When changing an endpoint

1. Update Jbuilder partial
2. Update `frontend/src/types/`
3. Update `frontend/src/api/` wrapper
4. Add/adjust `spec/requests/api/v1/` example
